                <note rend="inline" type="source">839.00/2339: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in the Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Russell</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-02-16T17:00:00-04:40"><hi rendition="#italic">February 16,
                                1921—5 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received February 17—2:15
                        p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>11. The seven members of the Commission with Judge Ostrand met and organized for
                    business today.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Russell</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
